  "description": "Geographic projections and map rendering for MatPlotLibNet. Includes Natural Earth 110m coastlines and country borders, and 13 map projections (PlateCarree, Mercator, TransverseMercator, Robinson, Orthographic, LambertConformal, AlbersEqualArea, AzimuthalEquidistant, Stereographic, Mollweide, Sinusoidal, EqualEarth, NaturalEarth). Choropleth maps with colormap support, points, bubbles, hexagon bins, the cells of the H3 index, flows and cartograms, and maps that come back from JSON.",
